        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Dress fabric, woven silk and metal thread.\nDisplayed behind glass. \nWarp: pink and yellow silk with white silk used as the binding warp.\nWeft: silk: pink, blue, green, black; metal thread: silver strip S-wound on white silk core.\nSelvedge: 2 cords of Z-spun S-plied cotton.\nThe ground is pale, presumably metal thread, with an ogival lattice formed by fine dark lines enclosing a dark stem with tiny leaves in what appears to be predominantly pink and black. Each ogee contains the same motif: an almost diamond shaped arrangement with 3 rosettes, 2 red ones and one blue one on the left.  There is a small curving leafy stem between the blue rosette and the central red one.  An elongated but unidentifiable motif goes from the lower right to just below the central rosette; its lower part is serrated and green and the upper part is pink - it looks a little like a very upright bird with a feathery tail."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/138b8972-c3d7-32ea-8313-51fbda9f8b42> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/76ae9fd0-fbd4-3624-a16f-c7c34ff1ef67> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Dress fabric, woven silk and metal thread.\nDisplayed behind glass. \nWarp: pink and yellow silk with white silk used as the binding warp.\nWeft: silk: pink, blue, green, black; metal thread: silver strip S-wound on white silk core.\nSelvedge: 2 cords of Z-spun S-plied cotton.\nThe ground is pale, presumably metal thread, with an ogival lattice formed by fine dark lines enclosing a dark stem with tiny leaves in what appears to be predominantly pink and black. Each ogee contains the same motif: an almost diamond shaped arrangement with 3 rosettes, 2 red ones and one blue one on the left.  There is a small curving leafy stem between the blue rosette and the central red one.  An elongated but unidentifiable motif goes from the lower right to just below the central rosette; its lower part is serrated and green and the upper part is pink - it looks a little like a very upright bird with a feathery tail."@en ;
